<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SGIO half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SGIO half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				     14.11 vs 18.76</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			4.0 vs 3.5</p>
<p>NOTE: SGIO Insurance Ltd is a Perth-based insurance company.  </p>
